# Forecast Calibration

- Workflow target: 200 forecasts/day/title via `/latos-tahmin` — not one commit
- Format: probabilistic claim, confidence, resolve_by, source or `unverified`
- Track Brier in `FORECASTS/CALIBRATION.md` (superforecaster ~0.166 benchmark)
- Recalibrate if Brier worsens 2 consecutive weeks — human gate
- Fermi decomposition + disconfirming evidence encouraged
